# Android Test & Profiling Outputs
# ====================================================================
*.apk
*.ap_
*.aab
*.dex
/captures/
.externalNativeBuild/
.cxx/

# ====================================================================
# Optional: NDK/Native Crash log (If you are using Native C/C++)
# ====================================================================
# 如果项目涉及 C/C++ 调试，可以忽略本地生成的崩溃日志或临时符号表
*.crash
*.symbols